doc_url.description:
The documentation of `code` in the API reference. Every error of this service carries it;
it is optional in the schema, as in Stripe's, so a client never fails on an error without
it.

EventObjectResponse.description:
An event (<https://docs.stripe.com/api/events/object>): what happened to an object of the
account in one mode, and who caused it. The same object is the body of every webhook delivery;
`GET /v1/events` is also the account's audit log.
